// Script Variable Greeting :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable Leave :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ARCmdr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IntroFirst Text :
"P920051313" "How can I help you, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P2265735354" "Are you in command of this unit?"
// Answer Text :
"P4058349605" "The Boardwalk is clear, what is next?"
// Answer Text :
"P2792789439" "Remind me of the plan."
// Answer Text :
"P1672635157" "Send me to Ground Zero."
// Answer Text :
"P953121068" "Circle of Thorns has been cleared out."
// Answer Text :
"P3473780223" "Send me to the Forgotten Forest."
// Answer Text :
"P539352352" "Mission accomplished, Commander."
// Answer Text :
"P912394731" "Nevermind."
// Page IntroAlly Text :
"P2998887589" "We are all quite inspired by your vicious assault, {HeroName}.  How may I be of assistance?"
// Answer Text :
"P2041946005" "The Boardwalk is clear.  We must advance..."
// Answer Text :
"P3031780036" "How are we progressing with the assault?"
// Answer Text :
"P1218112763" "Let us continue to Ground Zero."
// Answer Text :
"P1451660925" "Circle of Thorns has been cleared out.  We must advance."
// Answer Text :
"P3882641876" "How are we progressing with the assault."
// Answer Text :
"P651944702" "Let us continue to the Forgotten Forest."
// Answer Text :
"P2525319801" "What's your assessment of the situation?"
// Page IntroEnemy Text :
"P1657520893" "Let us get this over with quickly, {HeroName}, so we can both return to our tasks."
// Answer Text :
"P925598921" "Have your men escort me to Ground Zero."
// Answer Text :
"P1499744932" "Have your men escort me to the Forgotten Forest."
// Answer Text :
"P197796888" "Before we part ways. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P3933205394" "I shall linger a few moments more, contemplating the manner of your demise."
// Page HH1 Text :
"P1745777986" "Yes, I am, and let's be clear about one thing, {HeroName}.  I don't appreciate your presence here.  If circumstances were different, I'd bury you here on the beach.  However, I'd rather tolerate your presence in the face of overwhelming odds than risk returning from this island, my mission a failure."
// Answer Text :
"P378679085" "Feelings are mutual, you snivelling maggot."
// Answer Text :
"P4227475994" "I am confused, Commander.  Are we not allies in this endeavor, after all?"
// Answer Text :
"P4122793686" "Your impotence is amusing, but your insolence is not.  Be cautious, Commander."
// Page ARCmdrIntro2Direct Text :
"P359773561" "Are you so eager to die that you would insult me to my face, here, amongst all my power?  Hah!  If either of us could afford to slay the other, it would never have come to words.  You need my help here as much as I need yours, so you will play the part I elect for you; to sniff out the path for my troops and harry the enemy."
// Answer Text :
"P1024257605" "You're mistaken, I don't need you.  Things would be easier for me if you weren't here."
// Page ARCmdrRant1 Text :
"P3921789878" "I . . ."
// Answer Text :
"P2869956277" "Further, Commander, you're about three seconds from a horrific death."
// Page ARCmdrRant2 Text :
"P3417298717" "How Dare. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P657173746" "I would go into details but, for a pathetic lap-dog like you, I prefer to just 'wing it'."
// Page ARCmdrRant3 Text :
"P2683202220" ". . ."
// Answer Text :
"P481088394" "So, you will find a way to be of use or you will find yourself just another casualty."
// Page ARCmdrRant4 Text :
"P3949615022" "Perhaps. . . Uh, perhaps I was a bit hasty, and . . . Aggressive.  My most humble apologies, {HeroName}.  Clearly you are not one to be taken lightly.  Neither myself nor my men will hinder you further."
// Answer Text :
"P3390940672" "Wise decision, Commander."
// Page ARCmdrIntro3Formal Text :
"P3758522073" "Settled then? Good, now we can move forward.  We extracted a few large pieces of Shivan meteorite from the wreckage in Galaxy City.  No other facility in the world is so uniquely equipped to study the Shivan, so naturally those pieces came here."
// Answer Text :
"P613884925" "And that's when things when wrong."
// Page ARCmdrIntro4Formal Text :
"P1406136171" "Exactly.  We arrived here to find all personnel unaccounted for and the island overrun by Shivans.  Circle of Thorns and Freakshow have also gone out of control in our absence.  Our mission is simple: subdue the island, round up any stray civilians to be studied at our facilities on the mainland and find out what happened and whose neck is on the line.  We're now stuck with each other.  Whatever your purpose here is, I hope you have a good reason.  I wouldn't want you to be wasting your precious time."
// Answer Text :
"P529106675" "My reasons are not for you to question, Commander."
// Page ARCmdrIntro5Formal Text :
"P31207621" "You appear to be more trouble than you're worth, though you may prove me wrong.  I hear you were there when the meteors destroyed Galaxy City and you actually walked away from that.  Wouldn't it be amusing if you survived that, just to die screaming, here on a rock in the middle of the ocean?  If the Shivans want this place, they can have it, but we will extract our due before we cede one inch of beach to those creatures or any of the other degenerate fools that abide such a miserable existance as this."
// Answer Text :
"P439892951" "I assure you, I wont be the one screaming.  Are we done?"
// Page ARCmdrOutroFormal Text :
"P4034753142" "More than done.  Don't expect any more help from me, just stay ahead of my men and kill whatever you find.  We'll round up surviving citizens and maintain surveillance and if I find it convenient, I may even keep you warned of any incoming dangers.  Otherwise, get out of my sight."
// Answer Text :
"P2129464624" "Gladly."
// Page ARCmdrIntro2Cautious Text :
"P1779160511" "You're not easily baited, are you {HeroName}.  Very well, let's be done with this quickly.  As much as I loathe your presence here, I would be a fool not to find SOME use for you."
// Answer Text :
"P2588207243" "Frame it however you wish.  I expect to see your complete reconnaissance data."
// Answer Text :
"P3578131196" "You mistake your place, Commander.  You will be of use to ME, or you will be left here."
// Page ARCmdrIntro3Guarded Text :
"P1141982268" "Are you done?  This endless posturing is getting us nowhere.  Here is the sequence of events that have led us to this current situation: Fragments of the meteors that destroyed Galaxy City were shipped here to be studied.  We lost all communications shortly thereafter.  Reinforcements arrived to discover all personnel missing and Shivans running berserk through the city.  Freakshow and Circle of Thorns have likewise gone unchecked.  We need to subdue the island and get to the bottom of what happened here."
// Answer Text :
"P3260618365" "Simple.  Are we done?  Will you step aside now?"
// Answer Text :
"P2832260241" "So I get to do your job for you, great."
// Page ARCmdrOutroGuarded Text :
"P366837533" "Well, as long as you're getting the job done, taking all the risk, I'm happy to send you.  As you clear a path we will move in to secure it and should you get in over your head, we'll be here to scrape you off the pavement.  I learned early that if a soldier is suicidal over glory, it's a fool that stands in their way.  I win either way and, whatever you seek here, I see no reason to deny you, seeing how far you are willing to go."
// Answer Text :
"P2449748658" "Great.  Follow me, but keep your distance."
// Page ARCmdrIntro2Ally Text :
"P25467826" "I. . .Ally?  My apologies, {HeroName}.  I assure you I did not know.  My briefing suggested you were an outside operative, I . . .  Would you please provide some proof that you are who you say?"
// Answer Text :
"P281227846" "[Provide Authentic Credentials]"
// Answer Text :
"P2097876673" "[Attempt the Secret Authorization Code]"
// Page ARCmdrAllyTrue Text :
"P684900847" "This is all in order.  Well, it appears that I have a subordinate who shall be chastised sternly for this mix-up.  As you seem capable and fit to be my vanguard in this expedition, I place all my resources at your disposal."
// Answer Text :
"P2276914366" "Excellent, Commander Sulaco.  Here are my recommendations. . ."
// Page ARCmdrAllyFake Text :
"P3791298786" "Those codes. . . They are correct, albeit outdated.  You, of course, would not object to us sending for a verification of your identity?  Of course, it will take some time, as our telemetry was disrupted as soon as we approached the island.  Do not worry, {HeroName}, we shall get this sorted out.  In the meantime, let us get to planning."
// Answer Text :
"P124626979" "Excellent, Commander Sulaco.  Here's what I think we should do. . ."
// Page ARCmdrAllyPlan Text :
"P921601346" "That is a brash plan, but if you want to lead the assault yourself, I will not stand in your way.  You intend to clear out the Boardwalk of Freakshow, while we hold the rear and advance when you signal us.  It shall be as you say.  Is there anything else?"
// Answer Text :
"P3090355460" "No, Commander Sulaco.  We are in agreement, let us get underway."
// Page ARCmdrAllyClose Text :
"P3153080213" "Awaiting your advance."
// Answer Text :
"P1363974405" "Thank you, Commander."
// Page GZPrep Text :
"P2766525188" "We've identified members of Circle of Thorns in the cemetery in Ground Zero.  Initial recon suggests they are performing some type of magical experimentation on several Shivans they have managed to subdue.  As well, we believe that there are some civilians hiding throughout the cemetery."
// Answer Text :
"P2119979804" "Here are my plans..."
// Answer Text :
"P4109957263" "Seems simple enough.  We advance."
// Page ARCmdrGZ2 Text :
"P134925582" "It seems we are in complete agreement on both points.  If the Circle has primed these Shivans to be studied and experimented on, it would be advantageous for us to seize those specimens.  The same for the citizens, as their unique exposure to both the Circle's magic and the Shivan radiation would make them interesting candidates for 'observation'. Secure them a path and we'll ensure that they are detained upon their escape from the cemetery.  Anything else?"
// Answer Text :
"P378642422" "No, Commander Sulaco.  Let us continue."
// Page FFPrep Text :
"P449613243" "We've been attempting to locate the incursion spot for these Neo-Shivans and all our intel points to a heavily forested promontory to the Northeast that the locals refer to as the 'Forgotten Forest', capped by a section of beach called 'The Dead Coast'.  Quaint.  The existing Shivans on the island have been hiding there for the past few weeks, which has made it the focus of the Neo-Shivan assault.  Apparently the two factions hate each other."
// Answer Text :
"P3879972209" "We should move quickly then, here are my recommendations..."
// Answer Text :
"P2772040672" "Escort me there."
// Page ARCmdrFF2 Text :
"P2072864119" "As you say, given how they have behaved up until now, it is quite likely that only the Neo-Shivans will put up any resistance to us.  I trust your tactical assessment of the situation and am in full agreement that now is the time to strike against the heart of this Neo-Shivan assault.  We shall depart as soon as you are ready."
// Answer Text :
"P705326007" "Ready as ever, Commander."
// Page ARCmdrGZTP Text :
"P572249676" "You shouldn't be seeing this.  If you do, please notify an adult."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroA Text :
"P3121171307" "The island appears to be contained, {HeroName}.  Few Freakshow or Circle of Thorns remain alive after your assault and, while they have gone to ground, I am certain our sweeps will pick up the rest of them in short order.  After your victory over the Obliterator, energy levels across the island have returned to normal.  We take that as a signal that the Neo-Shivan assault has been fully countered.  As well, telemetry has been restored to the island, enabling normal communications and clearing the way for Arachnos to launch a full-scale scouring of Bloody Bay.  Most of the civilians detained have already been forcibly removed from the island to a nearby facility for further study and observation.  Of course, there is still so much left that needs to be catalogued and collected.  I wont trouble you with those tasks, though."
// Answer Text :
"P2515855614" "Anything else, Commander?"
// Answer Text :
"P1478438122" "Thank you for your help, Commander Sulaco.  Here we part ways."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroB Text :
"P585997199" "If I may say, I was deeply impressed by the ruthless and capable execution of your command.  You have dealt a fatal blow to the Freakshow and Circle of Thorns on the isle as well as single-handedly rebuffing a Neo-Shivan assault.  Bloody Bay has simmered in revolt under these factions for close to twenty years and you managed to subdue it in a matter of hours.  It is simply stunning to see you at work.  If left unobstructed, I would not be surprised to see you attain the rank of Commander within a few years.  That should prompt you to extreme caution though, {HeroName}.  Such aptitude invites both praise and secret scorn and some will wonder 'how will this upstart threaten my own career?' Well, just words to ponder."
// Answer Text :
"P3133470152" "They would be wise to consider me a threat, Commander."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroC Text :
"P2251110761" "I know that the authorization codes you provided are fake; whether you stole them or just made a lucky guess, I could not say.  If I had not just seen you slaughter an island full of adversaries, I would severely punish you for this chicanery.  I am not, however, easily disposed to taking such gambles... it would not be wise to bet that you are exhausted enough for us to take you now.  Further... I like your style.  It's hard enough to get anyone to stand up to the to the rigors of command for fear of what failure means.  You are not part of Arachnos and that is a disappointment.  If you ever come to a point where you wish to swear your allegiance to a powerful force, seek me out.  Until then, good luck to you, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P2835178398" "You are too trusting, Commander.  Trust is a foolish tendancy that you will soon regret."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroD Text :
"P4270628446" "Perhaps I was too hasty in dismissing you earlier, {HeroName}.  You are not Arachnos, but clearly you are a force to be reckoned with.  I would ask now that you depart this island without any further hassle and leave this to Arachnos to finish up."
// Answer Text :
"P2529098084" "I have what I came for.  You're luckily beneath my notice."
// Answer Text :
"P1190871343" "It's time to pay for your insolence..."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroE Text :
"P3265361523" "You would not dare to even strike an Commander of Arachnos, let alone kill one!  You would be hounded until the end of your days!"
// Answer Text :
"P3156006091" "It is sad what happened to Arachnos here. . . Killed to a man by the Shivans. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P3650174792" "Hah! I'm just messing with you Commander.  It is amusing to see you sweat."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroF Text :
"P110070630" "Wait, what?"
// Answer Text :
"P1596208346" "I did all I could to save them.  Oh well.  Goodbye Commander. . ."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroG Text :
"P630773694" "You shouldn't be seeing this."
// Page ARCmdrFinalOutroH Text :
"P1818655613" "I'm not sure I like your tone, {HeroName}.  Explain yourself."
// Answer Text :
"P3545595655" "Just idle musings, Commander.  Be well."
// Page IntroDead Text :
"P901513623" "The Commander lies crumpled on the ground, the life snuffed out of him."
// Answer Text :
"P37171556" "Nice working with you, Commander."
// DisplayName for ARCmdr :
"P168900975" "Commander Sulaco"
// DisplayName for N_Guard_02 :
"P1752581836" "Arachnos Elite Guard"

