// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ARScientist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page ARScientistIntro Text :
"P2239909974" "Everyone has a story, a role to play and a place to fit.  I wonder, how do you fit into the story of this island, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1390491775" "You know me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3375605337" "Cut the theatrics."
// Answer Text :
// Page ARScientistIntro1 Text :
"P2557472032" "I know that which is worth knowing.  I know why you are here and what you are seeking.  I know that you will only find part of the information you are after and that you will destroy anything that you find not of value.  I also know that you lack the proper tools to get what you want - tools that I can provide.  Should you agree to my terms, it could be profitable for both of us."
// Answer Text :
"P444336642" "That seems like a possibility, name your terms."
// Answer Text :
"P301444892" "Is your life worth trying to haggle with me?"
// Page ARScientistIntro1Cautious Text :
"P660533651" "It is not haggling if I already know your price.  The only question is if you will let your pride stand in the way of accepting a gracious offer."
// Answer Text :
"P813852917" "I think I can find out what I need to know without you."
// Answer Text :
"P2261420895" "Some collaboration would be helpful."
// Page ARScientistInstructions Text :
"P105882572" "Very well.  It is difficult to conduct independent research.  The chain of custody is onerous and nothing is done without the threat of sabotage from one's colleagues.  If only I could get some samples of my own, I should be able to do my own tests without fear of outside interference.  Take this extractor: I only need a small sample taken from as many of the meteors as you can.  I can remotely monitor and gather all the information I need as the samples are extracted, so whatever you gather for me, you also get to keep for yourself.  I estimate that such a paltry exertion of your near-limitless power would be worth access to such tools?"
// Answer Text :
"P1535635535" "Perhaps this will work out for you."
// Page ARScientistOutro Text :
"P1124419968" "Even when you think you're alone out there, I'll be watching."
// Answer Text :
"P683238695" "Charming."
// DisplayName for ARSc :
"P3868555618" "Night Widow Spy"

