// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-Civs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P1565208995" "Thank you! I'm so happy you're here.  I was almost cornered by Freakshow and ended up running in here to find myself surrounded by Circle of Thorns.  I managed to stay hidden from them, hiding behind tombs and headstones but it was only a matter of time before they found me, if you hadn't ventured by!"
// Answer Text :
"P638110298" "It's okay now.  Can you answer a few questions?"
// Answer Text :
"P2480146967" "I have no time for you!"
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P1481233327" "Of course, but please hurry, the way wont stay clear for me for very long!"
// Answer Text :
"P2033732254" "Are there any other civilians here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1665128840" "Do you know what the Circle doing here?"
// Answer Text :
"P2749451085" "What were the Shivan doing here?"
// Answer Text :
"P4026333754" "Can you find your way out?"
// Page CivInq Text :
"P1341372129" "I saw someone else sneaking around, but I never got a good look at them.  Perhaps it was another unlucky soul like me, but perhaps not&  Don't think they were a member of the Circle of Thorns though."
// Answer Text :
"P2449039325" "I'll find them, don't worry."
// Answer Text :
"P4094849437" "Worse case scenario, they're dead.  Best, they're's possessed."
// Page CivInq1 Text :
"P668257783" "I sure hope so!"
// Page CivInq2 Text :
"P3159603526" "What a horrible thought!  Is that how all heroes think of regular people like myself?"
// Answer Text :
"P3655545122" "You know it, now get out of here!"
// Page CoTInq Text :
"P3166697202" "I couldn't easily say.  Just like everything else on this island, the Circle became really aggressive ever since that massive flash of light in the base a few nights back.  I did hear, from my hiding space, a member of the Circle saying something strange though..."
// Answer Text :
"P4236186345" "Could you tell me about that flash?"
// Answer Text :
"P3896498279" "What did they say?"
// Answer Text :
"P1133856762" "That's enough on Circle of Thorns, let me ask you something else."
// Page CoTInq1 Text :
"P4113392402" "I saw it from the windows of my apartment.  A brilliant flash of blue light& or maybe it was green& I don't rightly remember as it was so bright I was half blinded by the darkness that followed.  All the power went out temporarily and I was left stumbling around.  And then as the power came back on, more Shivans that I had ever saw in one place came trudging up from the shore and I just about had an accident..."
// Answer Text :
"P2856944801" "Sounds terrifying."
// Page CoTInq2 Text :
"P2502091984" "That fellow you just dispatched - I heard him going on and on, almost babbling, about the Shivans! 'If they can talk, they can think!' I heard him say, 'if they can think, and magics that did not work against them suddenly now do, then. . . then. . .' Well, I wouldn't say that I would agree with him but I'm no sorcerer.  He said that the Shivans had souls!  I don't know what he meant to do.  First the Shivans attacked the Cemetery and then you arrived!"
// Page ShiInq Text :
"P1941469252" "When I first dared to venture from my initial hiding spot I saw that the Circle had captured a few of those Shivan monstrocities and had them ensnared by some terrible magic.  I couldn't say what purpose it was all for but it seemed nefarious, what with all the chanting and bowing and gesturing they were doing.  Sends a shiver down my spine just to recall the cruel sounds of that horrible chanting.  Whatever they were doing, it was interrupted when a whole gaggle of Shivans came storming up from the water to the North!  A real fight broke out then and I just tucked my head down and did my best to stay out of the way!"
// Answer Text :
"P408831276" "A 'gaggle' eh? Is that the word for a group of Shivan?"
// Answer Text :
"P487703328" "That's enough on the Shivan, let me ask you something else."
// Page ShiJoke Text :
"P2660899644" "As well as I can imagine.  Either a 'gaggle' or a 'schtroumpf', but does it really matter?"
// Answer Text :
"P3243483651" "I suppose not&"
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P1319274221" "I think I can. . . I'd ask for your assistance, but you've got someone else to rescue."
// Answer Text :
"P845971844" "Good luck!"
// Page PrivateOutro Text :
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P1769317805" "I thought I was a goner!  It's so stupid of me to have ventured in here!  Please, is the way clear?"
// Answer Text :
"P2712319757" "It is, but first, are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P3584876867" "I don't think so& at least, not that I've seen, but I've been hiding this whole time.  What was that?!  Oh please, just let me leave!  I don't want to think about what the Circle will do to me if they find me here when you've gone!"
// Answer Text :
"P403468506" "Don't worry, reinforcements will be here momentarily."
// DisplayName for Ira :
"P1172894205" "Ira Pendleton"
// DisplayName for Paulina :
"P461822903" "Paulina Raufi"

