// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_CivDia1 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-CivA 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro2 Text :
// Answer Text :
"P1392223717" "Do you know what the Circle was doing here?"
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page CoTInq Text :
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page CoTInq1 Text :
"P2080644973" "I saw it from the windows of my apartment.  A brilliant flash of blue light… or maybe it was green… I don't rightly remember as it was so bright I was half-blinded by the darkness that followed.  All the power went out temporarily and I was left stumbling around.  And then as the power came back on, more Shivans than I had ever seen in one place came trudging up from the shore and I just about had an accident..."
// Answer Text :
// Page CoTInq2 Text :
// Page ShiInq Text :
"P1885800889" "When I first dared to venture from my initial hiding spot I saw that the Circle had captured a few of those Shivan monstrosities and had them ensnared by some terrible magic.  I couldn't say what purpose it was all for but it seemed nefarious, what with all the chanting and bowing and gesturing they were doing.  Sends a shiver down my spine just to recall the cruel sounds of that horrible chanting.  Whatever they were doing, it was interrupted when a whole gaggle of Shivans came storming up from the water to the North!  A real fight broke out then and I just tucked my head down and did my best to stay out of the way!"
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page ShiJoke Text :
// Answer Text :
"P1556277375" "I suppose not…"
// Answer Text :
"P345898671" "That's enough on the Shivans, let me ask you something else."
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P1120797873" "I think I will be. . . I'd ask for your assistance, but you've got more important things to do."
// Answer Text :
// Page PrivateOutro Text :
// Page Intro3 Text :
// Answer Text :
"P967734569" "It will be.  Are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P863174534" "I don't think so. . . at least, not that I've seen, but I've been hiding this whole time.  What was that?!  Oh please, just let me leave!  I don't want to think about what the Circle will do to me if they find me here when you've gone!"
// Answer Text :
// DisplayName for Ira :

