// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_CivDia2 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-CivB 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P4187828316" "What a nightmare! My friends all warned me not to go jogging near the cemetery.  I don't think they had wacked-out cultists with their ritualistic ceremonies in mind when they tried to warn me.  What happened to all the NORMAL wierdos in the world?"
// Answer Text :
"P192301008" "That's one way of looking at the situation."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P1923698423" "Can I go now? I'd like to finish my run."
// Answer Text :
"P220437764" "Uh, seriously? Well, if you run West you SHOULD be safe."
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P2869934862" "Now that I think about it, maybe I should do some static stretches before my muscles get cold.  I'll just walk back in a few minutes.  Thanks again, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P1441415406" "Screw shortcuts, why did I run through here.  You HAVE to get me out of here!"
// Answer Text :
"P913883347" "I will.  Are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P2287485843" "Who cares about other people, you need to get ME out of here!"
// Answer Text :
"P1835243937" "Great.  Stay put for a little bit."
// DisplayName for Paulina :

