// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_CivDia3 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-CivC 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P2415300251" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  I was two weeks from retirement, about to get off this bloody rock and go back to Paragon City. . . Settle down, you know? See my new baby granddaughter grow up.  Open that restaurant that my wife and I have always dreamed of.  Almost lost all of it trying to play the hero out here today."
// Answer Text :
"P3856236512" "Sounds like you got a lot to live for."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P4208387024" "Even at my age, life is just too damned exciting to pass up even for a minute.  You probably don't have to worry much about the small things that plague a guy like me.  I envy you, running off to face danger at every turn.  You must lead an exciting life.  Now, what are you doing here, wasting your time talking to an old man like me.  You've got an island to save."
// Answer Text :
"P2323030560" "Thanks mister.  Good luck to you!"
// Answer Text :
"P11008092" "I'm going to look for that restaurant, next time I'm in Paragon City."
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P3244927442" "Hah, you know it, friend.  Come round after we're open and I'll take care of you.  I'm thinking about calling it the 'Live Forever Diner'."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P3213900376" "Thank God you're here.  A few of them strayed near my hiding place, so I had to take them out the old fashioned way, but I didn't think it'd be wise to try to make a break for it by myself."
// Answer Text :
"P3988133658" "Probably not.  Are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P1931540019" "Yes, there's a woman and a man.  I tried to sneak near enough to get their attention but they both seem too terrified to pay much attention to anyone or anything."
// Answer Text :
"P2000419913" "Don't worry, the way will be clear shortly."
// DisplayName for Logan :
"P2869242254" "Logan Ashcraft"

