// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_CivDia4 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-CivD 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P1288530725" "Oh man. . . I thought the Circle of Thorns was the worst I had to fear but then I go and get nabbed by Arachnos!  I don't want to be studied like a lab rat!  Please just let me go, I'll do whatever you want!"
// Answer Text :
"P2554559394" "Answer some questions for me and I'll consider it."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P917277416" "Y-yes.  I'll tell you whatever you want.  Just please don't let them hurt me!"
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P2546050273" "What were the Shivans doing here?"
// Answer Text :
"P1051926252" "I'm done with you."
// Page CoTInq Text :
"P2925286619" "I don't really know.  Just like everything else on this island, the Circle became really aggressive ever since that massive flash of light in the base a few nights back.  I did hear, from my hiding space, a member of the Circle saying something strange though..."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page CoTInq1 Text :
"P1207814064" "I saw it from the windows of my apartment.  A brilliant flash of blue light. . . or maybe it was green. . . I don't rightly remember as it was so bright I was half-blinded by the darkness that followed.  All the power went out temporarily and I was left stumbling around.  And then as the power came back on, more Shivans than I had ever seen in one place came trudging up from the shore and I just about had an accident. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P3660989501" "More on Circle of Thorns. . ."
// Page CoTInq2 Text :
"P2717632258" "One of the mages that you killed - I heard him going on and on, almost babbling, about the Shivans! 'If they can talk, they can think!' I heard him say, 'if they can think, and magics that did not work against them suddenly now do, then. . . then. . .' Well, I wouldn't say that I would agree with him but I'm no sorcerer.  He said that the Shivans had souls!  I don't know what he meant to do.  First the Shivans attacked the Cemetery and then you arrived!"
// Page ShiInq Text :
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page ShiJoke Text :
// Answer Text :
"P2762736229" "I suppose not. . ."
// Answer Text :
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P2423445641" "So, you're going to let me go, right?  Like we agreed to, right?!  Hey! Where are you going! You said you'd let me go!"
// Answer Text :
// Page PrivateOutro Text :
// Page Intro3 Text :
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro4 Text :
// Answer Text :
// DisplayName for Jesse :
"P3612827029" "Jesse Endress"

// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************
// ************************************************************************

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Generated by transModule
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_CivDia5 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-CivE 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P2305873264" "Thanks, {HeroName}.  My back's not as strong as it used to be but with all the fresh carcasses strewn about, I won't have to do any digging.  It's a hard life here on the island, but I make a go of it.  It's too bad those other civilians are still alive, I could have sold them back to their loved ones after I was finished."
// Answer Text :
"P3059660938" "Sounds like you have an interesting profession."
// Answer Text :
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P199829919" "Oh interesting, indeed! Waste not, want not, like my father used to say.  But now, I guess I'm to be packed off with the rest of cattle to rot in some Arachnos facility.  Oh, don't worry about me, I'll be fine.  I've jumped into enough graves in my time and I always land on my feet and manage to climb my way back out!"
// Answer Text :
"P4110361120" "Well, good luck.  I'm sure you'll prove a handful."
// Answer Text :
"P772702664" "I don't doubt it, perhaps I can help. . ."
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P409007798" "Hah, help would be great, friend!  I could even hook you up when next we meet. . . If you ever need to make it look like you died in a horrific accident or fire.  Just let me take out a policy on you first."
// Answer Text :
"P4184375150" "There's a shovel behind the next crypt and the guards are fools. Good luck!"
// Page Intro3 Text :
"P3731084132" "Huh? Oh you're interrupting me in my work.  Heh, these Circle minions thought they could get the jump on me.  Accidentally broke my shovel on the second one, now I'll have to go all the way home and return if I mean to finish my 'business' today."
// Answer Text :
"P2339594472" "'Business'?  Uh, nevermind.  Are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
"P2700742662" "Yes, there's a woman and a man.  Hopefully nothing untowards has happened to them since I saw either of them last.  Of course, if something DID happen to befall them, I'd pay good money to anyone interested in looking the other way. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P3096938627" "No promises."
// DisplayName for Tuttle :
"P531326042" "Tuttle DuBois"

