// Answer Text :
"P4039685173" "Well, no. . . You've been earmarked for dissection."
// Page CivOutro Text :
"P2438399240" "What? Oh - Hah-hah.  Yeah, like you're going to do that.  Listen jerk, I don't much like your attitude! You think you can intimidate me?  You had better think again!  If my heart rate falls too low, the whole jog will have been a waste!"
// Answer Text :
"P1247754751" "Oh, your heart rate will spike soon enough!"
// Page Intro3 Text :
// Answer Text :
"P3625784438" "No promises. Are there any other civilians in here?"
// Page Intro4 Text :
// Answer Text :
"P2979796010" "Hah.  Stay put for a little bit."
// DisplayName for Brit :
"P2380237336" "Britany Close"

