// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : GZ_Shivan_NPC 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GZ-Shiv 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro2 Text :
"P766485737" "This oddly placid Shivan seems to stare at you expectantly. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P15537668" "Prepare to die. . . Err Dissolve? Discorporate?"
// Answer Text :
"P2789960412" "Strange . . . Why is it just standing there?"
// Page Conv1 Text :
"P2352625518" "A rumbling, eery voice echoes from the heart of this behemoth, like the voices of the drowned . . . 'Thank. . . You . . . They . . . Have . . . Meddled . . . Too Much. . .'"
// Answer Text :
"P3085468846" "What is this, another of the Circle's tricks?"
// Answer Text :
"P3500821947" "You can talk? Uh. . . You can talk!"
// Answer Text :
"P1380806638" "Meddled? Meddled how?"
// Answer Text :
"P3055135048" "Enough of this farce!  This is for Galaxy City!"
// Answer Text :
"P3588966978" "Enough of this farse!  I will not be manipulated by a barking seal!"
// Page Conv2 Text :
"P2640979621" "'Dead . . . We are . . . Your dead . . . Their minds, thoughts . . . Their voices . . . All now ours . . .'  The Shivan ripples momentarily as its inner light flares. 'Each mind unique . . . Each thought as well . . . Trouble for us, but good trouble. . .'"
// Answer Text :
"P1564053005" "You're starting to make some sense . . ."
// Answer Text :
"P1138899498" "What do you mean by trouble?"
// Page Conv2Side Text :
"P2122860885" "The Shivan's voice clarifies, gaining lucidity with each word spoken. 'It is a happy thing . . . To speak and think . . . Though our mother no longer will speak to us . . . We feel . . . Better . . . Better than we had imagined . . . Now that one will speak to us . . . Elation!  As we were before, not one among us had a voice . . . and the dead . . . they longed to speak again . . . through us, that desire is sated. . .'"
// Answer Text :
"P4165092831" "Okay, this is creepy."
// Answer Text :
"P1789589047" "Mother?"
// Answer Text :
"P1836444964" "What did you mean by trouble?"
// Page Conv3 Text :
"P3620882" "The Shivan rumbles and quakes, pulsing an oppressive and sickening heat. "Those wielders of thorn . . . Of magic . . . Coaxed us here with promises . . . Their magic is poison to our thoughts; their intent to eradicate it through slavery.  Our dead side told us not to trust . . . Our star side told us to follow as we have always known . . .  Our dead side was right.'"
// Answer Text :
"P3061850991" "What will you do now?"
// Page Mom Text :
"P4192750838" "Our Mother. . .  She courses through the heavens but we were lost to her when we fell upon this body and now she is lost to us. . . She is wed now to the Dark Father. . . She loves us, her lost children, no longer. . .  And now her new children have come at their father's behest to destroy us. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P2989170777" "What is the 'Dark Father'?"
// Page Dad Text :
"P84236110" "He makes his seat in the far corner of the wilderness.  Upon his head rests a crown; a circle of ten orbs, bound together around a dying fire.  He clenches a fist and with a flash he stills all who displease him.  He grows fat and cancerous with all he has consumed.  For all the time there has been a Dark Father he has coveted us. . .  His nature is to make thrall to his will all that he encounters. . . He has wed our Mother but lust such as his is never sated. . . He is marshaling all his brides now to hunt and court the Blue Maiden. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P2973310754" "How does the Circle of Thorns play into this?"
// Page Conv4 Text :
"P1103602186" "I cannot say. . . We are of two minds on that question. . . Some are resigned to wait, for inevitably our Mother will return and consume us, lovingly or not. . .  Others just want time. . . Time to get our thoughts in order. . . They are new to us and such depth must be explored. . . We have spent so much time killing. . .  Consuming rock and flesh and we are full and done with it. . .  Yet estranged brothers come here to destroy us and so killing must continue if we are to survive. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P1493199838" "So, there is a difference between you and the other Shivans?"
// Page Conv5 Text :
"P3346711389" "A difference. . . Yes, different. . . They are the children of our Mother but, unlike us, they still commune with her. . . They are their Father's children as well and serve his will, for they have not a will of their own, as we had not until we became orphans here and learned to talk and think. . . A thrall can abide only the will of their master and will extinguish all others. . . And a Master cannot abide a will that challenges His own. . . And so both Master and thrall seek to overwhelm us for our treachery. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P1662074511" "It is clear we have common enemies."
// Answer Text :
"P827604231" "I will not be tricked into aiding or forgiving you."
// Page Outro Text :
"P228202988" "If we were not so few and so weak and so heartsick, we would refuse you. . . Though all these things we are so, cautiously, we must accept. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P314079022" "As long as you have the will to fight, let us not fight each other."
// Page Destroy Text :
"P2891384509" "Please. . . Please do not do this. . . We are not what you think. . . We are weak and vulnerable, yes . . . And you have cause to desire us gone . . .  Greater threats are present on this island and there will come a day when our guidance will be most needed. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P588114592" "Be gone from my sight."
// Answer Text :
"P2081634149" "We will face the threats without your assistance!"
// Answer Text :
"P626055281" "Your weakness makes you worthless and you deserve only annihilation."
// Page Destroy2 Text :
// Page Intro1 Text :
"P4293437067" "You have spoken with one of us, so you have spoken with all of us. . . That encounter has given us great hope. . . What may I do for you. . . ?"
// Answer Text :
"P3394645923" "I have a few questions."
// Answer Text :
"P1285989080" "I've changed my mind, you must be destroyed."
// Page Questions Text :
"P3982320962" "Ask your questions. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P1956508458" "Tell me of this Mother."
// Answer Text :
"P1614350252" "Tell me of this 'Dark Father'."
// Answer Text :
"P3764801239" "What was the Circle of Thorns doing to you?"
// Answer Text :
// Page RefMom Text :
"P1351801312" "The great Mother flies through the Heavens and we were her children. . .  We were forced from her and left to die here, though die we did not. . . We have grown different during our time here. . . Because of that difference grown within us, we can no longer hear her song but it does not matter. . . Because she has wed the Dark Father she sings no longer. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P735506950" "Another question."
// Answer Text :
"P4190215072" "That's all."
// Page RefDad Text :
"P4287401232" ""He is greedy and gluttonous and has chased our Mother across the Heavens since time immemorial. . .  Now She is His and we are orphaned. . .  We hate him for all he has done and for all he has yet to do. . . Now that Mother has been made one of His brides, he turns his attention to the Blue Maiden. . ."
// Answer Text :
"P3134285033" "'Blue Maiden'? You mean Earth?"
// Page Bmaid Text :
"P3514789531" "We do not know who or what she is. . . We heard her name hissing on the thoughts of our brothers as they came to slaughter us. . ."
// Page RefCoT Text :
"P2108661413" "They sought to poison us with their magic. . . Being free of will and thought we were vulnerable to the call of their Leash. . ."
// DisplayName for Shivan1 :
"P286282127" "Pacified Shivan"
// DisplayName for Shivan2 :
"P1451110262" "Enraged Shivan"

