// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LBCmdr 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IntroHappy Text :
// Answer Text :
"P3725427308" "I've been instructed to report to you."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P2422532978" "Please remind me of my task."
// Answer Text :
"P2505803023" "Please send me to Ground Zero."
// Answer Text :
"P16554282" "Circle of Thorns has been cleared out, what's next?"
// Answer Text :
"P3870249014" "Please send me to the Forgotten Forest."
// Answer Text :
"P2908088956" "Reporting for debriefing."
// Answer Text :
// Page IntroAngry Text :
"P2258532156" "How have you not gotten yourself killed yet, {HeroName}?  Well, if I must continue to suffer you can we at least get this exchange over quickly?"
// Answer Text :
"P296515025" "Gladly.  I shall take the fight to Ground Zero!"
// Answer Text :
"P4120470599" "Gladly.  I shall take the fight to the Forgotten Forest!"
// Answer Text :
"P1177528783" "Did I not tell you I would solve all your problems?"
// Answer Text :
"P3852325818" "I shall linger a few moments more, so you may revel in my magnificent presence."
// Page HH1 Text :
"P4015297488" "So you're the big guns, eh?  Well, {HeroName}, I definitely hope you can help.  Given all that has happened, they wouldn't send anyone that was less than capable."
// Answer Text :
"P1596882723" "Glad to be of service.  After Galaxy City we all need to help."
// Answer Text :
"P2280542252" "My goal here is information, if it furthers your cause as well, so much the better."
// Answer Text :
"P568921237" "I'm better than the riffraff you're used to commanding, step aside please."
// Page LBCmdrIntro2Cautious Text :
"P2949542368" "Information will benefit everyone concerned, and I hope you will be forthcoming with us as I am about to be with you."
// Answer Text :
"P1154380814" "Of course, please give me your findings."
// Answer Text :
"P3078561790" "That depends on the quality of your reconnaissance and of what I find out there. "
// Page LBCmdrIntro2Glad Text :
"P3576130911" "Hah, you're the real deal then, {HeroName}?  Well, I'm glad you're here.  Let's get down to the details."
// Answer Text :
// Page LBCmdrIntro2Offended Text :
"P3463127824" "Excuse me?  Look, I have civilians under my care, a lot of missing comrades on this island that, in all likelihood, are probably dead and my husband was killed in Galaxy City.  You walk in here with that attitude?  You HAVE to be joking, and its a poor joke at that.  I don't care if one of your powers is that you can pull the moon out of its orbit with that colossal ego of yours, you WILL fall in line."
// Answer Text :
"P3129272664" "Um.  Yes ma'am, sorry ma'am.  Please give me your findings...  Ma'am."
// Answer Text :
"P813872812" "Your weak countenance belies your amazing will.  Please continue Commander Nostromo."
// Answer Text :
"P2452250879" "The problems of one of your stature is beneath my cosmic notice."
// Page LBCmdrIntro3Formal Text :
"P1693346530" "We extracted a few large pieces of Shivan meteorite from the wreckage in Galaxy City.  No other facility in the world is so uniquely equipped to study the Shivans, so naturally those pieces came here."
// Answer Text :
// Page LBCmdrIntro3Guarded Text :
"P1328579227" "Well, fragments of the meteors that destroyed Galaxy City were shipped here to be studied.  We lost all communications shortly thereafter.  Reinforcements arrived to discover all personnel missing and Shivans running berserk through the city.  Freakshow and Circle of Thorns have likewise gone unchecked.  We need to subdue the island and get to the bottom of what happened here."
// Answer Text :
"P2675208745" "Sounds simple to me.  I'm not against a little bit of rough and tumble."
// Answer Text :
// Page LBCmdrIntro4Formal Text :
"P2206391602" "Exactly.  We arrived here to find all personnel unaccounted for and the island is overrun by Shivans.  Circle of Thorns and Freakshow have also gone out of control in our absence.  Our mission is simple: subdue the island, rescue civilians and find out what happened.  The problem is that we lack the resources to do this ourselves, and we need to get matters in hand before someone else decides to move on this."
// Answer Text :
"P593743548" "Thankfully I'm here."
// Page LBCmdrIntro5Formal Text :
"P767185302" "You're more than I could have hoped for.  I hear you were there when the meteors destroyed Galaxy City and you actually walked away from that.  I know this place probably looks like a blighted rock to you, but we've already lost enough to the Shivans; they can't be allowed to destroy anything more."
// Answer Text :
"P2215669665" "We agree on that, Commander."
// Page LBCmdrOutroFormal Text :
"P445210756" "Good.  You will be the vanguard and I will provide all the support I can to you and my troops will secure each area after you clear it.  We'll round up surviving citizens and maintain surveillance to keep you warned of any incoming dangers."
// Answer Text :
"P819092235" "Sounds simple.  Shall we?"
// Page LBCmdrOutroOutraged Text :
"P2631084247" "You-you're unbelieveable.  Get out of my sight.  Should you 'deign' to actually do something useful, we'll be here to clean up the mess, or scrape you up off the pavement."
// Answer Text :
"P1876782575" "Hah, you misunderestimate me!  Bloody Bay! Behold!"
// Page LBCmdrOutroGuarded Text :
"P3384795644" "Well, as long as the job is getting done, I'm happy to send you.  As you clear a path we will move in to secure it and should you get in over your head, we'll be here to scrape you off the pavement."
// Answer Text :
// Page GZPrep Text :
"P513329078" "We know that Circle of Thorns is infesting the Cemetery at Ground Zero.  Initial reconnaissance suggests they have managed to capture some Shivans and are performing some type of ritual on them.  As well, we've reason to believe that there are civilians trapped within the grounds."
// Answer Text :
"P1757121082" "Any thing else I should know?"
// Answer Text :
"P569836229" "Got it, I'm on my way."
// Page LBCmdrGZ2 Text :
"P736004896" "We think that a trio of mages - Eligos, Marchosias and Barbatos - are heading up the ceremonies being done there.  The rituals should be easy to spot, since they're each congregated around a large, pacified Shivan.  As for the civilians, we're not sure where they are; probably hiding amongst the tombstones.  You'll have to keep an eye out for them and I'm sure that if you clear a path, they'll be motivated to vacate the cemetery on their own two feet."
// Answer Text :
"P2658268545" "I'm on it."
// Page FFPrep Text :
"P1642180489" "There seem to be two factions of Shivan, because they're fighting right now up in the Forgotten Forest.  So far, the ones like those that you rescued, have been pretty docile towards us.  That's not working out too well for them, though, because reports suggest they are sustaining heavy losses.  We should move before the Neo-Shivans eradicate them all."
// Answer Text :
"P1670922741" "Anything else I should know?"
// Answer Text :
"P1915625941" "Got it, I'm on my way?"
// Page LBCmdrFF2 Text :
"P3820726536" "The forest is currently overrun.  I've got some troops in the area, but they probably won't be of any assistance to you.  We're picking up some pretty heavy energy signatures from up along the Dead Coast, so you should probably head North from your starting location, clearing out the hostile Shivan as you go."
// Page LBCmdrGZTP Text :
// Page LBCmdrFinalOutroA Text :
"P1068481185" "Fantastic, {HeroName}! Truly incredible!  I knew that they were sending the best, but I did not expect such results and so quickly!  This island has simmered in conflict for years and you turned the whole place inside out in a matter of hours!"
// Answer Text :
"P2912086123" "You are too kind, Commander. Anything else before I go?"
// Page LBCmdrFinalOutroB Text :
"P2985874230" "Well, {HeroName}, I'm not sure what to say.  At first I took you for a buffoon, but maybe there's something to this 'cosmic defender' act of yours.  Please accept my humble apologies."
// Answer Text :
"P1196975373" "No, please forgive me and my quirky sense of humor."
// Answer Text :
"P2657567335" "Surely you can grovel more convincingly!"
// Answer Text :
"P3103707958" "Yes, I am magnificent, aren't I?"
// Page LBCmdrFinalGeneral Text :
"P1974879818" "If you wish to speak with any of the civilians rescued from the cemetery, they are here with me.  Other than that, there is nothing else but for me to reiterate the importance of what you've done here today."
// Page LBCmdrFinalConfounded Text :
"P3804542840" "Um. . . Well, right.  The civilians from the cemetery might want to thank you.  I'm certainly done with you. Good luck, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P3219688343" "Farewell, lesser being."
// DisplayName for LBCmdr :
"P2676183559" "Commander Nostromo"
// DisplayName for N_Guard_01 :
"P3283846428" "Longbow Elite Guard"

