// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : data/scripts/SpawnDefs/Trial_BloodyBay/_src/Trial_BB_Spawns.xls 	Sheet : LBScientist 
//
// Script      : Xlstospawndef.bat 
// Version     : 38 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// Script Variable Greeting :
// Script Variable Leave :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LBScientist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page LBScientistIntro Text :
// Answer Text :
"P414933304" "I'm looking for information."
// Answer Text :
"P2065041199" "You what passes for a specialist around here?"
// Answer Text :
// Page LBScientistIntro1 Text :
"P1368709813" "Good information is in short supply around here.  You come here with questions, and I'm not sure I can answer you, but I can help."
// Answer Text :
"P3398306532" "That's understandable, go on."
// Answer Text :
"P2862666001" "Seriously? Well if that's the best you can offer, go on."
// Answer Text :
"P3978748872" "Maybe you and I can find those answers . . . together."
// Page LBScientistIntro1Cautious Text :
"P601557768" "Look, I'm instructed to help you, so if I give you the tools can you go figure it out on your own so I don't have to keep talking to you?"
// Answer Text :
"P3727290946" "That's probably best for both of us."
// Answer Text :
"P3741251274" "I'm sorry, some instructions would be helpful."
// Page LBScientistInstructions Text :
"P2236624382" "We've got fragments of something great here… we're really on the cusp of a major breakthrough, I just need a little help tying it all together.  I'll give you this ore extractor; if you've ever been to this island before, it should be familiar to you.  If not, just go up to as many of the meteors as you can find and take a sample.  I'll check up with you out in the field to take notes and secure your research."
// Answer Text :
"P1842884252" "It's as simple as that?"
// Page LBScientistOutro Text :
"P1040256396" "It's as simple as that."
// Answer Text :
"P2420087866" "Goodbye."
// Page LBScientistBrushoff Text :
"P1053377737" "I'm sorry, you must have me confused for some other blue-skinned scientist."
// Answer Text :
"P2292026039" "I'm sorry, your help would be appreciated."
// Answer Text :
"P392187756" "Ah, come on!"
// DisplayName for LBSc :
"P1481156070" "Longbow Scientist"

